OVERVIEW: List archive contents

USAGE: dicom-archive list --archive <archive> [--format <format>] [--show-instances]

OPTIONS:
  -a, --archive <archive> Path to the archive
  -f, --format <format>   Output format: tree, table, json (default: tree)
  --show-instances        Show individual instances
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

